mapping "V8523.1" source="V8523" target="36198007" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V8523 SNOMED CT 36198007 418161006 = Swedish ICD-10 SE extension of V85.2 (Person på utsidan
        av specialfordon skadad i trafikolycka) adding an activity dimension (sport/leisure/work/vital
        activities/other/unspecified). No direct Athena crosswalk for the Swedish 6-character extension;
        inherits the crosswalk from the parent ICD-10 base code V85.2. Targets: SNOMED CT 444074; SNOMED CT
        4168046. Both targets fully subsume the source (every case is a vehicular/traffic accident
        victim and a vehicle accident event); the activity context, vehicle position, and vehicle type
        are lost. broader mapping. Confidence (primary target) / (secondary): mechanical crosswalk from
        parent base code applied to Swedish extension, not independently re-verified; significant
        specificity loss (activity/position/vehicle-type dimensions dropped).
        """
}
